        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-1970P, Elite Collection High End Modern Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe High End Modern Appliance Pull will be a great addition to your luxury home. This refrigerator handle is packaged with the mounting hardware to install it on a standard appliance panel. The Elite Collection High End Modern Appliance Handle is available in several modern finish options. Choose from 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia AP-1970P pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/high-end-modern-cabinet-pull-omnia-1970\"><b>Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the High End Modern Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>1970P/305:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>1970P/457:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
